WEBVTT

00:00:05.417 --> 00:00:07.463
[panting]

00:00:10.597 --> 00:00:12.163
[growling]

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:14.949
Cut it!

00:00:32.009 --> 00:00:33.837
Where's the
Dragon Warrior?

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:36.884
- How do you know
you're not looking at her?
- [laughing]

00:00:37.014 --> 00:00:39.190
You think I'm a fool?

00:00:39.321 --> 00:00:42.672
I know you're not the
Dragon Warrior. None of you!

00:00:42.803 --> 00:00:46.197
I heard how he fell out
of the sky on a ball of fire.

00:00:46.328 --> 00:00:50.462
That he's a warrior
unlike anything
the world has ever seen.

00:00:50.593 --> 00:00:56.338
- Po?
- So that is his name. Po.

00:00:56.468 --> 00:00:59.559
Finally, a worthy opponent.

00:00:59.689 --> 00:01:03.432
- Our battle will be legendary!
- [snarling]

00:01:17.359 --> 00:01:19.361
- [grunts]
- [shouts]

00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:23.974
We've got this. Help her.

00:01:48.216 --> 00:01:51.306
- Monkey!
- Go!

00:01:51.436 --> 00:01:52.786
What was I thinking?!

00:01:56.877 --> 00:01:57.965
[shouts]

00:02:03.057 --> 00:02:04.275
Mantis!

00:02:09.237 --> 00:02:10.891
Now!

00:02:25.557 --> 00:02:29.126
- [screaming]
- Ah!

00:02:33.522 --> 00:02:35.132
[thumping]

00:02:55.762 --> 00:02:59.156
- [gasping]
- Shifu taught you well.

00:03:01.898 --> 00:03:04.031
But he didn't
teach you everything.

00:03:07.991 --> 00:03:09.384
[Shifu]
You have done well, panda.

00:03:09.514 --> 00:03:13.214
Done well? Done well?

00:03:13.344 --> 00:03:14.781
I've done awesome!

00:03:16.391 --> 00:03:19.350
The mark of a true hero
is humility.

00:03:19.481 --> 00:03:22.789
- But, yes, you have done...
- Ow!

00:03:22.919 --> 00:03:24.181
...awesome.

00:03:24.312 --> 00:03:25.574
[both laughing]

00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:30.361
- [footsteps approaching]
- Huh?

00:03:31.536 --> 00:03:34.844
Guys? Guys?!
They're dead!

00:03:34.975 --> 00:03:38.108
No, they're breathing. They're
asleep? No, their eyes are open.

00:03:38.239 --> 00:03:40.371
We were no match
for his nerve attach.

00:03:40.502 --> 00:03:42.678
He's gotten stronger.

00:03:42.809 --> 00:03:45.594
Who? Tai Lung? Stronger?

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:49.076
He's too fast!
Sorry, Po.

00:03:50.947 --> 00:03:54.342
- I thought we could stop him.
- He could have killed you.

00:03:54.472 --> 00:03:56.083
[groaning]
Why didn't he?

00:03:56.213 --> 00:03:58.825
So you could come back and
strike fear into our hearts.

00:03:58.955 --> 00:04:04.308
- But it won't work.
- It might. I mean, a little.

00:04:04.439 --> 00:04:05.570
I'm pretty scared.

00:04:05.701 --> 00:04:07.268
You can defeat him, panda!

00:04:07.398 --> 00:04:10.053
Are you kidding?
If they can't?!

00:04:10.184 --> 00:04:13.404
They're five masters.
I'm just one me.

00:04:13.535 --> 00:04:16.973
But you will have the one thing
that no one else does.

00:04:22.065 --> 00:04:24.546
You really believe
I'm ready?

